flowchart TB
    User([User]) -->|Natural Language Question| UI[Next.js Chat UI]
    UI -->|POST /api/v1/query| API[FastAPI Backend]

    subgraph Understanding["Understanding & Retrieval"]
        direction TB
        Classifier[Query Classifier]
        SchemaLinker[Schema Linker]
        SchemaMeta[(schema_metadata)]
        Retriever[BM25 Example Retriever]
        Examples[(few_shot_examples)]
        Generator[SQL Generator<br/>Claude Sonnet 4.5]

        Classifier -->|Intent: ANALYTICAL| SchemaLinker
        SchemaLinker -->|Relevant Meta| SchemaMeta
        SchemaMeta -->|Column Descriptions| Retriever
        Retriever -->|Top-3 Q-SQL Pairs| Examples
        Examples -->|Few-Shot Examples| Generator
    end

    API --> Classifier
    Generator -->|Raw SQL| Guardrails

    subgraph Execution["Execution & Safety"]
        direction TB
        Guardrails[Security Guardrails]
        GuardrailsCfg[(guardrails config)]
        Executor[SQL Executor<br/>read-only engine]
        Retry{Execution OK?}
        Formatter[Result Formatter<br/>NL Summary + Chart Hint]
        Transpiler[sqlglot Transpiler<br/>multi-dialect]

        Guardrails <-->|SELECT-only rules| GuardrailsCfg
        Guardrails -->|Sanitized SQL| Executor
        Executor --> Retry
        Retry -->|Failure: self-heal once| Generator
        Retry -->|Raw Rows| Formatter
        Formatter --> Transpiler
    end

    Executor <-->|Query / Rows| MySQL[(MySQL e-commerce DB)]
    Transpiler -->|NL Summary + Table| UI
    UI -->|Answer| User

    QueryLogs[(query_logs)]
    Formatter -.->|audit trail| QueryLogs

    classDef store fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#92400e
    classDef llm fill:#e0e7ff,stroke:#4f46e5,color:#312e81
    classDef edge fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#1e3a8a
    class SchemaMeta,Examples,GuardrailsCfg,QueryLogs,MySQL store
    class Generator,Formatter llm
    class UI,API edge
